{
  "id": "fuel_equivalents___online_calculator",
  "title": "Fuel Equivalents - Online Calculator",
  "description": "Online fuels energy equivalents calculator for oil, gas and more. Convert between common fuel energy equivalents including Btu, natural gas, and other fuel types.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "datatable",
      "headers": [
        "Fuel Type",
        "Unit",
        "Equivalent to 1 Unit",
        "Reference"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Oil",
          "Barrel",
          "5.8 Million Btu",
          "Standard reference fuel"
        ],
        [
          "Natural Gas",
          "1000 ft³",
          "1000 Btu",
          "Gross heating value"
        ],
        [
          "Natural Gas",
          "Nm³",
          "9400 kcal",
          "Gross heating value"
        ],
        [
          "Natural Gas",
          "Nm³",
          "39.4 MJ",
          "Gross heating value"
        ],
        [
          "Coal",
          "Short Ton",
          "21.3 Million Btu",
          "Standard reference fuel"
        ],
        [
          "Electricity",
          "kWh",
          "3.412 Btu",
          "Standard conversion"
        ],
        [
          "Wood",
          "Cord",
          "20-25 Million Btu",
          "Varies with moisture content"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "source_value",
          "label": "Source Value",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 100,
          "unit": "Btu"
        },
        {
          "id": "source_fuel",
          "label": "From Fuel Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Btu",
              "value": "btu"
            },
            {
              "label": "Oil Barrel",
              "value": "barrel"
            },
            {
              "label": "Natural Gas nm³",
              "value": "gas_nm3"
            },
            {
              "label": "Natural Gas 1000 ft³",
              "value": "gas_1000ft3"
            },
            {
              "label": "Coal (Short Ton)",
              "value": "coal"
            },
            {
              "label": "Electricity (kWh)",
              "value": "electricity"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "target_fuel",
          "label": "To Fuel Type",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "label": "Btu",
              "value": "btu"
            },
            {
              "label": "Oil Barrel",
              "value": "barrel"
            },
            {
              "label": "Natural Gas nm³",
              "value": "gas_nm3"
            },
            {
              "label": "Natural Gas 1000 ft³",
              "value": "gas_1000ft3"
            },
            {
              "label": "Coal (Short Ton)",
              "value": "coal"
            },
            {
              "label": "Electricity (kWh)",
              "value": "electricity"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "result",
          "label": "Equivalent Value",
          "formula": "inputs.source_value",
          "unit": "varies",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "### How to Use\n\n1. **Select Source Fuel Type**: Choose the fuel type and unit you want to convert from\n2. **Enter Value**: Input the quantity to convert\n3. **Select Target Fuel Type**: Choose the fuel type you want to convert to\n4. **View Result**: The equivalent value will be calculated automatically\n\n### Reference Standards\n\n* **Natural gas equivalents** assume *1000 Btu/ft³* gross - or *9400 kcal/Nm³* or *39.4 MJ/Nm³*\n* **Standard reference fuels** are statistical units with defined gross heat content\n* All conversions based on gross heating values\n\n### Example\n\nThe equivalent of *100 Btu* energy approximates to *0.0025 nm³* of natural gas."
    }
  ]
}